.TH GREENCRYPT-GUI 1 "2026-10-19" "GreenCrypt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
greencrypt-gui \- Qt graphical interface for GreenCrypt
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B greencrypt-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B greencrypt-gui
starts the Qt (PySide6) graphical interface of GreenCrypt, an
AES-256-EAX file and folder encryption tool.
.PP
The graphical interface provides the same operations as the command-line
tool: encrypt and decrypt files and folders, choose a password, and
optionally delete the originals.
.SH OPTIONS
This program takes no command-line options.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR greencrypt (1)
